  choose bd hbd using fun a j => _root_.GlobalTheory.MBLow.jc_bound V D C hCE N ν hInt q hq m hmOdd (Q a) (s' a) (ff a) (hs'V a)
    (hfam a).2.2.2.1 (gm₀ j) (gm j) (hT j).2.1 (hT j).2.2
